rfectly with the definition of sarcasm.\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 final conclusion  \nthe meme is **sarcastic** because the **intended meaning (\"i wish he weren't\") is the opposite of the literal meaning (\"i wish he were\")**, and the phrasing is used to **critique or mock the harmful comparison** between putin and hitler.\n\n$$\n\\boxed{\\text{yes}}\n$$",
